<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1409] Refactor rat build on Travis.CI PR build to avoid timeouts</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1409</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Some PR builds are failing with timeout when executing RAT checks, and these checks are running on each of the individual builds. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
No output has been received in the last 10 minutes, this potentially indicates a stalled build or something wrong with the build itself.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The build has been terminated&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Moving RAT to it&apos;s own profile and running only once per PR build seems to alleviate these time outs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
